	measure ExitReasonsRanked = ```
			
			VAR MonthlyExitReasons = 
			    SUMMARIZE(
			        SummarizedData,
			        SummarizedData[DischargeMonth],
			        SummarizedData[GroupedExitReason],
			        "TotalExits", SUM(SummarizedData[Exits])
			    )
			RETURN
			    RANKX(
			        FILTER(MonthlyExitReasons, [DischargeMonth] = SELECTEDVALUE(SummarizedData[DischargeMonth])),
			        [TotalExits]
			    )
			
			```
		lineageTag: 3ae09f63-8ecd-4ab9-95e6-a515bb90160d

